{"path":"/zh/concepts/task-dag-state-machine/","title":"任务 DAG 与节点状态机","blocks":[{"block_id":"adps-47a47c768182de1d-1","revision":"47a47c768182de1d1f32baffb90c7265ef25b57a4a1c0425fdf10442996f2abb","tag":"p","quote":"薪酬任务要先创建薪资组，再关联员工，然后计算、审批和提交。“审批”依赖计算结果；审批节点自身又会经历待执行、进行中、等待人工、完成或失败等状态。"},{"block_id":"adps-26d7ac44c2b3982b-1","revision":"26d7ac44c2b3982bcab1fbd3bcd86d1780d186d131cafa450935bfff1b5c670b","tag":"p","quote":"只在提示词里写“请按顺序执行”，无法支持并行节点、中断恢复和局部重试。依赖关系与节点状态需要成为程序可读的一等数据。"},{"block_id":"adps-9f27f2366da64164-1","revision":"9f27f2366da64164dd05c9000bed0555580d30366ac4d7f0dc62e449fc27c751","tag":"p","quote":"任务 DAG 用有向无环图表示步骤依赖，节点状态机记录每个任务的运行状态。二者共同把流程顺序从自然语言说明转换为可调度数据。"},{"block_id":"adps-bea739bf085098da-1","revision":"bea739bf085098daf5bf0c6a8b7ba4c791873e30dfa8286b0c8fc81a89733f53","tag":"p","quote":"节点通常包含 ID、目标、依赖、状态、验收条件和结果引用。下游节点只有在所有依赖节点完成、前置条件通过后才能进入 ready。"},{"block_id":"adps-1c5be8d6dd0b0633-1","revision":"1c5be8d6dd0b06335f14c7c8ffaefbc50eedd51488ad1e0d4ab780783ab91f13","tag":"p","quote":"规划执行由五类组件组成："},{"block_id":"adps-09a64c9c3c11fe1b-1","revision":"09a64c9c3c11fe1bd699ef5caedb2ca243745fe4c4e5ed77296439daedfecfe7","tag":"li","quote":"Planner 生成或局部修订任务图；"},{"block_id":"adps-e045c463eb089157-1","revision":"e045c463eb0891576c7e242b12e554fb952b8a684abec4c369c14a50a4a4636f","tag":"li","quote":"Scheduler 计算可运行节点；"},{"block_id":"adps-06f5fa22e68b24f7-1","revision":"06f5fa22e68b24f7e233909027e3ac688f66309e0c278ca028027e8ee3af53db","tag":"li","quote":"Executor 执行当前节点；"},{"block_id":"adps-af0828ed97614410-1","revision":"af0828ed97614410a53d1a91d2801e27a2aa324b04da004b6b3572ce4dabe577","tag":"li","quote":"Validator 核对业务回执和验收条件；"},{"block_id":"adps-7a59c3f2704b239a-1","revision":"7a59c3f2704b239aea29ce22b26c7e921ac0c28f17336a2daca81285acd9c935","tag":"li","quote":"Workspace 持久化图、状态迁移和 Checkpoint。"},{"block_id":"adps-7b4ec1e0501cf93e-1","revision":"7b4ec1e0501cf93ef5e9d2e77d8fb3823ecbe3f895e4b2cb308ed99e5ac0ae0e","tag":"p","quote":"常见状态包括 pending、ready、in_progress、awaiting_approval、completed、failed 和 blocked。每次状态转换都应记录触发事件和计划版本。"},{"block_id":"adps-1f1ba459ce027273-1","revision":"1f1ba459ce027273bd64941a180a7b12b51413fd294a58f5fc456851fd0045eb","tag":"p","quote":"ReAct 用于任务结构尚不明确的阶段。依赖关系形成后，Orchestrator 把控制权交给规划执行。失败时可以替换受影响子图，保留已经验收的节点。"},{"block_id":"adps-299fc91645ff87d9-1","revision":"299fc91645ff87d9001af9712878031b3319f01c3ecca0194974a2248cf21f1e","tag":"p","quote":"薪资组快速搭建要求先创建快照，再导入模板，导入失败时回滚。早期实现把顺序写入 Skill 并交给 ReAct，测试中出现跨步和漏步。任务 DAG 上线后，依赖边限制了可调度顺序，模型不再逐轮决定先后。"},{"block_id":"adps-ccf7e74441d9f97c-1","revision":"ccf7e74441d9f97cc255570da038e3a427551d25cf4aba337a16ba419907e181","tag":"p","quote":"同一状态机也支持 HITL。敏感节点进入 awaiting_approval，审批通过后回到 ready，拒绝后进入 blocked 或触发替代计划。"},{"block_id":"adps-8669531cc4afb7c8-1","revision":"8669531cc4afb7c827d70deffd3045703c166f05a11d00378c56d6ea0ddcdcbd","tag":"p","quote":"当流程包含严格先后关系、并行分支、失败恢复或人工审批时，应使用任务 DAG 与状态机。调度状态与其他状态的边界见会话统一状态，审批恢复见HITL 阻塞与恢复。"},{"block_id":"adps-6f383e93b8d68765-1","revision":"6f383e93b8d68765ef75becf3f85f392b03eff290889d4b6b29128cd1e90d03e","tag":"p","quote":"初始来源：东方屹腾执行型 Agent 案例报告；案例提供：梁博（Bo Liang）。"},{"block_id":"adps-07336cb1f093d306-1","revision":"07336cb1f093d306f9f6694518f0138fa9925bd53440f26b6e21d427504c348d","tag":"p","quote":"案例报告目录 · 模式目录 · CC BY 4.0"},{"block_id":"adps-3c551855df185a69-1","revision":"3c551855df185a69bba5e6c436054cab73b1e5df7050f512e066b3f937c0e637","tag":"p","quote":"在 ADPS Chronicle 中查看"}]}
